  "prompt": "Create a new painted animation in-between atlas for devil, matching the reference identity exactly: winged brown-scaled horned dragon demon, gold pendant, green wrist/ankle wraps, long tail and claws. Preserve full horns, wings and tail.  Exactly sixteen new COMPLETE full-body painted reaction sprites, 4 columns x 4 rows. Attached image is ONLY identity/costume reference. New pose order: Row1: guard absorbing hit; small head recoil; hunched body hit; big backward recoil arms spread. Row2: stumbling; dizzy hunched; launched backward through air; upside-down air tumble. Row3: wall impact arms spread; crumple onto knee; falling backward; ground bounce legs in air. Row4: on hands and knees getting up; one-knee get-up; thrown through air; lying knocked out. Follow original head-to-feet directions in every pose. Face right in standing poses; airborne fall and KO have head left and feet right. Small transitional shifts toward these reactions. All figures must be complete and fit inside their own cell with 12% empty padding. No anatomy clipped inside drawing either. Same physical body size, lying/crouched figures naturally shorter. No extra figures or detached parts. Pure flat magenta #ff00ff background, no grid, text, shadows, blur, effects or stars."
